  "releaseNotes": "IMPROVEMENT: Capture Request and Response Http headers on both HTTP entries and exits\nIMPROVEMENT: Refactored the instrumentation by modifying ExtractCallData to include the typeName in the data\nIMPROVEMENT: Added missing versions to the supported versions list\nNEW: Upgrade support for StackExchange.Redis to version 2.13.1\nNEW: Upgrade support for Grpc.Net.Client to version 2.80.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore to version 10.0.7\nNEW: Upgrade support for Google.Cloud.PubSub.V1 to version 3.34.0\nNEW: Upgrade support for NLog to version 6.1.3\nNEW: Upgrade support for CouchbaseNetClient to version 3.9.2\nNEW: Upgrade support for MongoDB.Driver to version 3.8.1\nNEW: Upgrade support for Aerospike.Client to version 8.4.1",
